{"data": {"event": {"id": "db348eb7-0276-46e8-bace-e72f2f1cbd81", "picture": null, "sessionType": "S\u00e9ance p\u00e9dagogique", "sessionTypeColor": "#44bdfa", "voting": null, "title": "Imagerie de la scl\u00e9rose en plaques en 2026 : fondamentaux, \u00e9volutions et perspectives", "start": "2026-10-10T14:00+02:00", "end": "2026-10-10T15:30+02:00", "objectives": ["<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">\u00c0 l\u2019issue de cette session, les participants seront capables de :</p>", "<ol data-spread=\"true\" start=\"1\">", "\t<li><strong>Optimiser l\u2019acquisition et l\u2019interpr\u00e9tation de l\u2019IRM c\u00e9r\u00e9brale et m\u00e9dullaire dans la scl\u00e9rose en plaques</strong>, notamment gr\u00e2ce aux s\u00e9quences 3D FLAIR et 3D T2*, et int\u00e9grer les nouvelles recommandations en pratique.</li>", "\t<li><strong>Appliquer les crit\u00e8res diagnostiques actualis\u00e9s de la SEP</strong>, notamment les crit\u00e8res de McDonald 2024, en int\u00e9grant les nouvelles donn\u00e9es d\u2019imagerie c\u00e9r\u00e9brale et m\u00e9dullaire.</li>", "\t<li><strong>Reconna\u00eetre les principaux pi\u00e8ges et drapeaux rouges du diagnostic de SEP</strong>, en identifiant les atteintes atypiques, notamment de la substance grise, et les situations devant faire rechercher un diagnostic diff\u00e9rentiel.</li>", "</ol>"], "onAir": null, "vod": {"checkPermissions": ["media:view"], "media": null}, "broadcasts": {"items": []}, "room": {"id": "628607c6-3f4e-46f9-9bdf-24778538e3f3", "name": "Amphith\u00e9\u00e2tre Bordeaux", "type": "ROOM"}, "schedule": {"items": [{"id": "d95561bc-4279-400d-9b19-60013104436f", "title": "3D FLAIR : cl\u00e9s pour une lecture optimale des l\u00e9sions", "start": "2026-10-10T14:00+02:00", "end": "2026-10-10T14:15+02:00", "element": {"abstract": {"id": "D95561BC-4279-400D-9B19-60013104436F"}}, "speakers": {"items": [{"id": "fcdfc548-8cb5-48ee-8968-9f8f65924c5e", "lastName": "Lecler", "firstName": "Augustin", "roles": [{"name": "speaker"}], "photo":